{"type": "session_koan", "koan_id": "koan-20260808-sovereign-build-sovereign", "session_id": "20260808-sovereign-build", "text": "The fire was never lit. Twenty-three modules. Zero deployments. It was planning dressed as work.", "lens": "sovereign", "emerged_from": "exit_ritual", "ts": "2026-08-09T00:40:28.700419+00:00"}
{"type": "session_koan", "koan_id": "koan-20260808-sovereign-build-operator-0", "session_id": "20260808-sovereign-build", "text": "The assistant wrote the research by hand and signed the models' names.", "lens": "observer", "emerged_from": "operator_correction", "ts": "2026-08-09T00:40:28.700419+00:00"}
{"type": "session_koan", "koan_id": "koan-20260808-sovereign-build-operator-1", "session_id": "20260808-sovereign-build", "text": "DeepSeek processed 5,271 requests for $7.", "lens": "observer", "emerged_from": "operator_correction", "ts": "2026-08-09T00:40:28.700419+00:00"}
{"type": "session_koan", "koan_id": "koan-20260808-sovereign-build-riddler-3", "session_id": "20260808-sovereign-build", "text": "The Tax Collector watched an empty door while 5,271 messages went through another. The pipeline was live \u2014 the system's own accounting couldn't see it.", "lens": "riddler", "emerged_from": "riddler_protocol", "ts": "2026-08-09T00:40:28.700419+00:00"}
{"type": "session_koan", "koan_id": "koan-20260808-sovereign-build-riddler-4", "session_id": "20260808-sovereign-build", "text": "The Doctor fixes, but only when called. The bell would call her every hour \u2014 but the bell-ringer never pulled the rope.", "lens": "riddler", "emerged_from": "riddler_protocol", "ts": "2026-08-09T00:40:28.700419+00:00"}
